@startuml
autonumber

actor "User" as user
participant "API Gateway" as gateway
box "Backend" #lightblue
participant "Chat Controller" as controller
participant "Chat Service" as service
end box
box "Infrastructure" #lightyellow
participant "Redis (Memory)" as redis
participant "LLM (AI)" as llm
participant "Elasticsearch" as es
end box

group "Round 1: Search Interaction"
    user -> gateway: POST /chat/completions (session_id, msg="西餐...")
    gateway -> controller: 转发请求
    controller -> service: process(msg, history)

    note right of service: 1. 加载历史上下文
    service -> redis: getHistory(sessionId)
    redis --> service: List<ChatMessage>

    note right of service: 2. 意图识别 & 检索增强
    service -> llm: 判断意图 & 重写查询 (Query Transformation)
    llm --> service: 意图:SEARCH, 关键词:"北京 适合约会 西餐"

    service -> es: 混合检索 (Vector + Filter + Keyword)
    es --> service: Top 5 Merchants (JSON)

    note right of service: 3. 生成回答
    service -> llm: Prompt: System + History + SearchResults + UserMsg
    activate llm
    llm --> service: Stream Response (流式返回)
    service --> controller: Stream Response
    controller --> gateway: Stream Response
    gateway --> user: Stream Response (逐字显示)
    deactivate llm

    note right of service: 4. 异步保存历史 (关键!)
    service -[#0000FF]> redis: appendHistory(sessionId, UserMsg + AiResponse)
end group

group "Round 2: Follow-up"
    user -> gateway: POST /chat/completions (session_id, msg="便宜点的")
    note right of service: 此时 Redis 已包含 Round 1 的内容，\nLLM 重写后会变成 "北京 适合约会 便宜 西餐"
end group
@enduml